---
title: RunPickingList State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Issued : picking sheet issued off an approved plan version
    Issued --> Picking : first QR label scan (keeper starts picking)
    Picking --> Picking : scan more labels / split batches
    Picking --> Ready : every gather + allocation split fully picked
    Picking --> NeedsHandling : keeper reports exception (Shortage/Damaged/Expired/QrMismatch)
    Issued --> NeedsHandling : exception before any scan
    Ready --> [*]
    NeedsHandling --> [*]
